<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on mark/Swiss franc.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on mark/Swiss franc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse said it has issued three million American-style call and put warrants, in three equal tranches, on the mark/Swiss franc exchange rate.</p>
<p>One warrants gives the right to buy or sell 100 marks.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> WARRANT  STRIKE  PRICE     PREMIUM   GEARING	 DELTA</p>
<p> CALL     80.0    1.90 SFR  0.84 PCT   42.75 TIMES  +0.61</p>
<p> CALL     82.5    0.80 SFR  2.56 PCT  101.53 TIMES  +0.32</p>
<p> PUT	81.0    1.85 SFR  2.55 PCT   43.90 TIMES  -0.54</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 16.SEP.96-08.SEP.97   PAYDATE	13.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  DEM/CHF = 81.22</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
